{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00184",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 0.78,
      "end_seconds": 6.78,
      "duration_seconds": 6.0,
      "text": "Doctor, your next patient is here. I've done the basics, I'll read them out in a moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.31,
      "end_seconds": 11.54,
      "duration_seconds": 3.23,
      "text": "Thanks, that's helpful. Hello, please sit. What's been happening?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 12.0,
      "end_seconds": 34.86,
      "duration_seconds": 22.86,
      "text": "I've been wanting to stop smoking, and I wanted to get it checked. I just want to get back to normal, really. I'd rather not end up on lots of tablets if I can avoid it. I'd been getting out of breath quicker than before, but that went away."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 35.53,
      "end_seconds": 38.57,
      "duration_seconds": 3.04,
      "text": "Sorry, the computer needs a moment to load this."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 39.27,
      "end_seconds": 40.1,
      "duration_seconds": 0.83,
      "text": "No rush."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 47.46,
      "end_seconds": 52.34,
      "duration_seconds": 4.88,
      "text": "Right, thanks for waiting. Have you had any chest pain or weight loss?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 53.02,
      "end_seconds": 56.52,
      "duration_seconds": 3.5,
      "text": "No, um, none of that at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 60.1,
      "end_seconds": 62.93,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "Any low mood or alcohol problems at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 64.09,
      "end_seconds": 67.13,
      "duration_seconds": 3.04,
      "text": "Hmm, no. None of those, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 67.37,
      "end_seconds": 71.59,
      "duration_seconds": 4.22,
      "text": "Go on. I'll try to keep this as efficient as I can."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 72.32,
      "end_seconds": 74.8,
      "duration_seconds": 2.48,
      "text": "Thank you, I appreciate it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 75.4,
      "end_seconds": 82.21,
      "duration_seconds": 6.81,
      "text": "Do you have any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for? I'm asking so that we don't miss anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 83.58,
      "end_seconds": 90.63,
      "duration_seconds": 7.05,
      "text": "High blood pressure, for about a year. My sister suggested writing things down, but I forgot."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 92.02,
      "end_seconds": 101.33,
      "duration_seconds": 9.31,
      "text": "Mm-hm. Okay, high blood pressure, that's already on your record. Good to know. Okay, have you been able to keep up with your usual activities?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 101.96,
      "end_seconds": 115.54,
      "duration_seconds": 13.58,
      "text": "Hmm, for the most part, yes. I just carry on and try not to dwell on things too much, though I won't pretend it hasn't crossed my mind a few times."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 116.59,
      "end_seconds": 118.21,
      "duration_seconds": 1.62,
      "text": "Any operations in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 119.65,
      "end_seconds": 123.07,
      "duration_seconds": 3.42,
      "text": "I had a knee arthroscopy three years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 123.88,
      "end_seconds": 128.43,
      "duration_seconds": 4.55,
      "text": "Is it all right if a trainee sits in later? No? Fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 128.89,
      "end_seconds": 133.07,
      "duration_seconds": 4.18,
      "text": "I'd rather not, uh, if you don't mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 134.12,
      "end_seconds": 136.33,
      "duration_seconds": 2.21,
      "text": "Does anything run in the family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 137.42,
      "end_seconds": 140.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "Yeah, my father had a stroke."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 140.83,
      "end_seconds": 154.58,
      "duration_seconds": 13.75,
      "text": "Just so you know how the rest of the visit will go: I'll finish my notes, we'll agree on the plan, and the front desk will help with anything that needs booking. You shouldn't need to chase anything yourself."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 156.14,
      "end_seconds": 162.12,
      "duration_seconds": 5.98,
      "text": "Uh, um, good, I was wondering how this would go."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 162.83,
      "end_seconds": 163.53,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Any smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 163.89,
      "end_seconds": 166.64,
      "duration_seconds": 2.75,
      "text": "I smoke about ten cigarettes a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 167.72,
      "end_seconds": 172.41,
      "duration_seconds": 4.69,
      "text": "Is there anything you were hoping to get out of today's visit?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 173.8,
      "end_seconds": 179.47,
      "duration_seconds": 5.67,
      "text": "Right, uh, mostly I just want to understand what's going on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 179.89,
      "end_seconds": 180.83,
      "duration_seconds": 0.94,
      "text": "Any regular medication?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 182.07,
      "end_seconds": 183.38,
      "duration_seconds": 1.31,
      "text": "No, nothing regular."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 184.86,
      "end_seconds": 188.3,
      "duration_seconds": 3.44,
      "text": "What about allergies, to medicines or foods or anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 189.44,
      "end_seconds": 190.33,
      "duration_seconds": 0.89,
      "text": "No allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 191.13,
      "end_seconds": 194.38,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "Is it okay if I type while we talk?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 195.83,
      "end_seconds": 199.08,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "Yes, uh, of course, go ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 200.19,
      "end_seconds": 209.75,
      "duration_seconds": 9.56,
      "text": "Doctor, I've got the readings for you. SpO2 97 percent on room air, blood pressure 125 over 77, temp 36.6 degrees, heart rate 64."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 210.21,
      "end_seconds": 213.25,
      "duration_seconds": 3.04,
      "text": "Okay, noted. How's everything else at home otherwise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 214.2,
      "end_seconds": 221.35,
      "duration_seconds": 7.15,
      "text": "Busy. Everyone's running in different directions at the moment, you know, you know how it is."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 224.16,
      "end_seconds": 228.1,
      "duration_seconds": 3.94,
      "text": "Alright, I'd like to examine you now. Please come over here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 229.29,
      "end_seconds": 231.36,
      "duration_seconds": 2.07,
      "text": "Now bend it for me, slowly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 241.48,
      "end_seconds": 246.25,
      "duration_seconds": 4.77,
      "text": "Chest sounds clear, a bit of wheeze when you breathe out hard."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 248.83,
      "end_seconds": 260.22,
      "duration_seconds": 11.39,
      "text": "Okay, you can sit back up. Thank you for that. I'll write up what I found in a moment, and then I'll tell you what I think is going on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 261.07,
      "end_seconds": 265.63,
      "duration_seconds": 4.56,
      "text": "Bear with me, I need to finish this line in the notes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 274.02,
      "end_seconds": 280.33,
      "duration_seconds": 6.31,
      "text": "Good, where were we. From what you've told me and what I found, it fits best with nicotine dependence."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 281.31,
      "end_seconds": 286.17,
      "duration_seconds": 4.86,
      "text": "I've been thinking the worst, to be honest. Is it bad?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 286.83,
      "end_seconds": 298.75,
      "duration_seconds": 11.92,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's nicotine dependence, and we'll know more once the breathing tests is back. Is there anyone at home who can help you out if you need it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 302.99,
      "end_seconds": 312.34,
      "duration_seconds": 9.35,
      "text": "Yes, there's family around most evenings, and they've been very good about checking in, although they do worry more than they need to."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 313.3,
      "end_seconds": 320.68,
      "duration_seconds": 7.38,
      "text": "We should do breathing tests for smoker's cough. That will help us see what's going on underneath and decide the next step."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 321.97,
      "end_seconds": 324.88,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "Alright. When can I do that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 326.4,
      "end_seconds": 337.09,
      "duration_seconds": 10.69,
      "text": "I'll start you on nicotine patches, 14 milligrams, once a day, for six weeks. That should help with smoking cessation. It's a commonly used medicine and most people tolerate it well."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 337.6,
      "end_seconds": 341.04,
      "duration_seconds": 3.44,
      "text": "Yeah, okay, and I take that after food?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 342.07,
      "end_seconds": 356.36,
      "duration_seconds": 14.29,
      "text": "Pick a quit date this month, and tell your family so they can back you up. Avoid taking any extra painkillers on top of what I'm prescribing without checking with us. I'll also refer you to the stop-smoking clinic."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 357.41,
      "end_seconds": 358.92,
      "duration_seconds": 1.51,
      "text": "Alright, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 360.24,
      "end_seconds": 373.44,
      "duration_seconds": 13.2,
      "text": "Keep an eye out, and if the symptoms get worse, call us the same day or go to emergency. Let's review you in two weeks. Can you run through the plan with me quickly, just to be certain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 374.9,
      "end_seconds": 379.21,
      "duration_seconds": 4.31,
      "text": "So, I come back in two weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 380.27,
      "end_seconds": 384.29,
      "duration_seconds": 4.02,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Okay, we're done for today. Take care."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 385.01,
      "end_seconds": 389.07,
      "duration_seconds": 4.06,
      "text": "No, I think that's everything. Thank you, doctor."
    }
  ]
}